Preprocessor fixtures. The expected clean source is written by hand; a marker
immediately before a token says that the token carries a non-nil "!" (the
marker is the oracle for the offsets). Section 6.1 and 6.7 of the RFC.

-- SYN-LA-01/src --
package p

func f() {
	w := adder(!flag)(3)
	_ = w
}
-- SYN-LA-01/want --
package p

func f() {
	w := adder(!flag)(3)
	_ = w
}
